  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Drexl</defName>
    <label>drexl</label>
    <description>Drexls (also known as 'warbeasts') were reptavian winged creatures indigenous to Onderonian moon of Dxun. In early stages of Onderon history, drexls were feared predators that spread terror, attacking the primitive Onderonian villages. The creatures were later trained as mounts by the Onderonian outcasts, who came to be known as 'Beast Riders'. Their viciousness as 'warbeasts' resulted in them being unintentionally spread to numerous worlds where they readily carved out an ecological niche.</description>
